      content:
          'As discharge planning begins, the team must decide between discharge to a long-term acute care facility (LTAC), a skilled nursing facility (SNF) with ventilator capability, or home with a home ventilator program. Each option has significant implications for insurance coverage, caregiver burden, and quality of life.',
